            <ArticleTitle>Prehospital pain control: nitrous oxide inhalation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>15-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain control in the prehospital emergency setting is often a neglected aspect of patient care. This article reports findings from 6 months of nitrous oxide use in the field. Its safety and effectiveness in selected cases is demonstrated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
